", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391934_2332433587219826_3583268111283018752_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QQxUSoTSdQEQ7kNvwGtyAzs&_nc_oc=AdpdpsCDpXLhtB3h-ypHQt0OsCPusYpQm8AOMS1JponDnOzJoMXYbg8i8V6kxcPSofI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQG98sNRnKLqH2qmfmgXR2HVpFTtIMjba-2xxnjWS1XWLQ&oe=6A8EE430"}, {"file_name": "1.3_PuzzleLevel_028.png", "id": "1836994227070784", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391911_1836994230404117_1890935279929871499_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Q9UucTzCnEoQ7kNvwGxTR6X&_nc_oc=Adqu9tnyScGATeNfnICtTageMwgCiUkdxn762Ax1JB6OKC0lGOGS5Q9WHO1Z8eINew4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGpF_DtAr8I4kdO8rdOYTn4cmGTkC9bB8R-VBom8iMxOA&oe=6A8ECB07"}, {"file_name": "2.1_PuzzleLevel_023.png", "id": "980481747324553", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391934_980481753991219_471152226523097550_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=t0Cyc6VCHdIQ7kNvwEsGI6_&_nc_oc=Adq1hV0lEeL0UgGjO6CXmx0H1iZ4_HWrB-x9J1bmEjfK28od9QBXhGzfjJdKeKdwO1k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEFz285cPaFX-k1lyBF4964cEQtS62JPpc7jsK-yhwkxA&oe=6A8EBFA6"}, {"file_name": "2.2_PuzzleLevel_005.png", "id": "629250039801395", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392016_629250043134728_2118689073029424993_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2x-_n5z5YPEQ7kNvwFXL7F2&_nc_oc=AdoPeqIDYcxvRCs5hUJYjqPmO06v_gM7M_RXIzzyOoCYJYD3_FeMh2CSMQrGvwj82lg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHvt-oKTm7XSF9xH0H_EMhQbTRCyuurtpoGFULWDVzuTA&oe=6A8EE752"}, {"file_name": "2.3_PuzzleLevel_010_Vers3.png", "id": "640340928639659", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392016_640340931972992_938618552754180062_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oXMPr28kEawQ7kNvwFGnkNv&_nc_oc=AdpFGP5zaJ4abCX9lGqkfPH-RPWxiFdmKlJuvAVMq8BiW9E8IxjhkfA6M5FhLi9GG-c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQF0a1sPg_W9q0k9UfI6h4eNS3FLxHKyjI7yh7_7vqlvNQ&oe=6A8EF375"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "VersX.png", "id": "905403181768105", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035377_905403185101438_6180565823629151945_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GBlmJSG8QPcQ7kNvwHqIgSm&_nc_oc=AdofggTDPvsraaxFv5ofpQTDBkf-kNIOdIVY3bdhAckEk2YpNupbmVh3KehuOdtXz7M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFTmlzZomkoHL-ryHko7YlrIp2-xGQbnmAOFJTtv60cdg&oe=6A8EC1E0"}, "display_name": "Selina: Mind at Large", "keywords": ["Puzzle", "Narrative", "Surreal", "Emotional", "Physics"], "long_description": "\nJump into the magic world of Selinas mind and master tricky physics-based puzzles to protect her memories from looming shadows and immerse yourself in a bittersweet tale about courage that will captivate your heart and mind!!\n\n{462054049934411}\n{3846354725676153}\n- Turn the world on it's head in a series of physics-based puzzles using the gravity defying *Escher-Teleport*\n\n- Embark on an heartwarming journey alongside Selina across otherworldly spaces of impossible architecture\n\n- Follow a moving tale about the shadows in our mind through fully animated character interactions\n\n\n\n{1270178880992449}\n\n{469944256054407}\n\n\n\n\n\n\nInfluenced by the writings of Carl Gustav Jung, ***Selina: Mind at Large*** is offering a unique and imaginative perspective into the mind of a child. Are you prepared to help Selina and push back against the sinister Aniles and her shadows?\n\n\n{1955927098148751}\n\n{655503446907375}\n\u201cSelina: Mind at Large attempts one of the most challenging tasks a game can achieve: transporting you into the shoes of a child. ... you return to feeling like a child yourself, in wonder for the gravity-changing hijinks that ensue, and the personal struggles underneath.. Isn\u2019t that what we want in games?\u201d - UploadVR\n\n{1358786278632654}\n\n\n\n\n", "short_description": "Guide the magic waters of Selinas mind through tricky physics-based puzzles to protect her memories from looming shadows and immerse yourself in a bittersweet tale about courage that will captivate your heart and mind!!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.selinavr.com/selina-privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Trotzkind GmbH", "support_website_url": "https://www.selinavr.com/", "website_url": "https://www.selinavr.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "1008279844328894"}, {"id": "377978390272490"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "de", "fr", "pt_BR", "zh_CN", "ja", "es_MX"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "29448241418157985"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001676_2233461320362684_788008089222440850_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ojv77yBO-HAQ7kNvwGa1XCN&_nc_oc=AdoIaoWD5T-b4WSw85a8Tiye5_qK0sHFBn2Ax3Mq-hNJIZi7xxdaslYng7r-15tIquU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFSsH-fTF3wZ9EwnJiqsFK_Jy-t4C6THpFUAr0BThIF2w&oe=6A8ED5A6"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Selina: Mind at Large", "pl